  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "Seven p.m. at Worcester.",
      "at": 0.5,
      "duration": 1.36,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "The line is out the door, the Grill is running low,",
      "at": 1.96,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "and every table is full.",
      "at": 5.99,
      "duration": 2.18,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "This is Dineamics. Three thousand students eat here every night,",
      "at": 17.15,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "and the kitchen has to guess how much to cook.",
      "at": 20.77,
      "duration": 3.97,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "We take tonight's real menu and play it out, student by student.",
      "at": 25.5,
      "duration": 3.71,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every dot is a student. When a line builds up, an alert tells you where.",
      "at": 29.31,
      "duration": 4.66,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "Click a station to see who's waiting, and how much is left in each pan.",
      "at": 34.06,
      "duration": 5.11,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now try a change. We run thirty nights with the same students both times,",
      "at": 43.9,
      "duration": 4.89,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "so the difference comes from the decision, not luck.",
      "at": 48.89,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "The What-If Lab shows every trade-off, with honest ranges.",
      "at": 54.3,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press Optimize, and it searches eighty kitchen plans,",
      "at": 60.8,
      "duration": 3.05,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "then charts waste against stockouts, so you can pick the balance.",
      "at": 63.95,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "One click adopts the plan for that night.",
      "at": 70.9,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "Or just ask Sam the Minuteman, our planning agent.",
      "at": 75.7,
      "duration": 3.03,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask a what-if in plain English, and he shows you what changes.",
      "at": 78.83,
      "duration": 4.53,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiger Data's vector search finds the past nights most like tonight.",
      "at": 85.1,
      "duration": 4.43,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "For Friendsgiving dinner on November 18th, the closest match is 98 percent similar.",
      "at": 89.63,
      "duration": 5.7,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the end, the manager gets a cook sheet:",
      "at": 99.5,
      "duration": 3.1,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "how many pans to cook, and when, for every dish, station by station.",
      "at": 102.7,
      "duration": 4.97,
      "y": "h-120"
    },
    {
      "text": "And a waste outlook for the next eight nights, built on synthetic history and real menus.",
      "at": 114.0,
      "duration": 6.38,
      "y": "h-120"
    }
  ]
}